// PSS v3.0 LRM — Example 71: join_none (page 147)
activity {
  L1 : parallel join_select(1) {
    L2: do A;
    L3: do B;
  }
  L4: do C;
}
activity {
  L1 : parallel join_none {
    L2: do A;
    L3: do B;
  }
  L4: do C;
}

assigned the same resource instance completes last, then action C, because it starts execution after the
previous action completes, will also start its execution after the completion of the first action.
